── Client WITHOUT elicitation / sampling capabilities ────────────────────────

▶ update_grade → cannot ask for confirmation, nothing changes
  callTool({"name":"update_grade","arguments":{"student_id":"2201005","course_id":"CS202","semester":"2030-9","process_score":8,"final_score":7.5}})
  ✔ 0ms → 
    {
      "isError": true,
      "text": "Cannot ask the user for confirmation (SdkError: Client does not support form elicitation.). The grade was NOT changed."
    }

▶ generate_student_feedback → no LLM to borrow
  callTool({"name":"generate_student_feedback","arguments":{"student_id":"2201010"}})
  ✔ 0ms → 
    {
      "isError": true,
      "text": "The host did not provide an LLM for sampling (ProtocolError: Method not found)."
    }

▶ 2026 era: missing capability is rejected by the SDK (-32021)
  callTool({"name":"update_grade","arguments":{"student_id":"2201005","course_id":"CS202","semester":"2031-1","process_score":8,"final_score":7.5}})
